  "category": "data",
  "description": "Interactive chart explorer — bar, line, area, pie, radar, scatter, bubble, quadrant, box, violin, heatmap, hexbin, contour, candlestick, waterfall, ribbon, rule, region and hull, plus Architecture recipes over metrics measured from this repo: Robert Martin’s main sequence, hotspots, complexity × coverage, fan-in × fan-out and god modules. Tweak orientation, position, colour, pattern, hulls, contours and opacity live, with guided suggestions.",
